{"name":"Silkworm","hex":"#eeeecc","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"silkworm","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Any of various caterpillars of moths that produce silk cocoons, especially Bombyx mori, the source of most commercial silk."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/silkworm"}],"entries":[{"title":"Silkworm (missile)","blocks":[{"text":"The SY, and HY series were early anti-ship cruise missiles (ASCM) developed by the People's Republic of China from the Soviet P-15 Termit missile. They entered service in the late 1960s and remained the main ASCMs deployed by the People's Liberation Army Navy through the 1980s. The missiles were used by the PRC and export customers to develop land attack cruise missiles (LACM)."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/SY-1_Missile_20170919.jpg/330px-SY-1_Missile_20170919.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Silkworm_(missile)"},{"title":"Silkworm (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Silkworm is an American indie rock band active from 1987 to 2005 and from 2024 onward whose core members are Tim Midyett, Andy Cohen, and formerly, Michael Dahlquist."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Silkworm_(band)"},{"title":"Bombyx mori","blocks":[{"text":"Bombyx mori, commonly known as the domestic silk moth, is a domesticated moth species belonging to the family Bombycidae. It is the closest relative of Bombyx mandarina, the wild silk moth. Silkworms are the larvae of silk moths. The silkworm is of particular economic value, being a primary producer of silk. The silkworm's preferred food are the leaves of white mulberry, though they may eat other species of mulberry, and even leaves of other plants. Domestic silk moths are entirely dependent on humans for reproduction, as a result of millennia of selective breeding. Wild silk moths, which are other species of Bombyx, are not as commercially viable in the production of silk."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/47/Pairedmoths.jpg/330px-Pairedmoths.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bombyx_mori"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/09/HY-1_shore-to-ship_missile_2015_Military_Museum_Beijing.jpg/500px-HY-1_shore-to-ship_missile_2015_Military_Museum_Beijing.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/09/HY-1_shore-to-ship_missile_2015_Military_Museum_Beijing.jpg/1280px-HY-1_shore-to-ship_missile_2015_Military_Museum_Beijing.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/09/HY-1_shore-to-ship_missile_2015_Military_Museum_Beijing.jpg/500px-HY-1_shore-to-ship_missile_2015_Military_Museum_Beijing.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"HY-1 missile on its land-based launcher","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHY-1_shore-to-ship_missile_2015_Military_Museum_Beijing.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Silkworm_%2832915633822%29.jpg/500px-Silkworm_%2832915633822%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Silkworm_%2832915633822%29.jpg/1280px-Silkworm_%2832915633822%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Silkworm_%2832915633822%29.jpg/500px-Silkworm_%2832915633822%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Iraqi HY-2 captured by Coaliation force in the Gulf War","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASilkworm_(32915633822).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wiki